            "review_text": "lewwby\nAuchtermuchty, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nValue for money is exceptional\nDec 2017 • Couples\nThis quaint little restaurant in Binh Thanh is a must visit if you are in or near the area.\n\nTheir isn’t a great variety in what you can eat as the menu is quite small however, what they do have is exceptional!! \n\nI had the ‘sticky’ rice and a baguette both of which contained chicken.\n\nThe sticky rice was literally something else - I’ve never had anything like it before in my life. The dish cost a measly 20k - I would have easily paid between 50-80k for it.\n\nThe vibe in the restaurant is refreshing. It’s young locals and the venue plays decent Vietnamese music.\n\nAs mentioned, I’d recommend this place. It’s cheap and more than cheerful! \n\nGood quality food!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2017",
