            "review_text": "David W\n25 contributions\n0\nCheap and nice cafe\nNov 2016 • Couples\nWe just wanted something light for dinner. This place is clean, quiet, air conditioned, so a nice respite from the hot, noisy city. Spring rolls were cheap and excellent. Chicken banh mi the same. Mango and banana smoothie and mint chocolate iced drink a bit more expensive but very nice, especially the smoothie. The only thing we didn't like so much was the sticky rice with pork (luncheon meat?), though it was certainly sticky!\nWould visit again\nRead more\nWritten November 12, 2016",
