            "review_text": "Timotheus Lee for Asia Travel Gems\nSingapore, Singapore136 contributions\n0\nCharming Cafe\nSep 2014 • Friends\nWe were staying at Binh Thanh district, and decided one night to explore the neighborhood for dining places. We found this place, and decided to give it a try.\n\nWe were pleasantly surprised. The food was good. The ambience very contemporary. Crowd was young and hip. The coffee was excellent, too.\n\nWe managed to speak with the owner of this place. Really friendly and nice guy. He told us he just started the cafe two weeks ago. We couldn't tell. The service was so good and efficient. Better than many restaurants we have tried.\n\nWe could see this cafe becoming really successful. Maybe even branches in District 1 eventually.\n\nVisit and try!\n\nP.S. I have few photos of the establishment to share. But don't know why TripAdvisor does not have option to add photos when it is a new listing. This is not the first time. I experienced the same lack of photo adding option when I added another dining place - from my previous Hong Kong trip. TripAdvisor, any views on this?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 8, 2014",
